WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
CLASSIC v1 · The Pair
Original Long Barrel stops at its first rival. Real gameplay, with time cuts.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:16.000
LINKED TROUBLE · A new run
Choose Close Coil. Its impacts pulse into nearby rivals.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:27.000
THE PAIR · Coil run, continued
One target click focuses Relay. Defeat it to remove Rivet's protection.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:41.000
SMALL TROUBLE · Later in the Coil run
Circular impact pulses catch the cluster, not just the first rival.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:53.000
THE PAIR · Separate Long Barrel run
A bolt hits two aligned rivals. The second hit is weaker. Pure autopilot here.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:01:04.000
THE CHIEF · Back to the Coil run's ending
Five encounters. A real win. A fresh run. No extra campaign or chores.
